      "content": "idk im just worried about the cost of the ER and i dont want to freak him out if its just the fever. he literally just said he feels 'fine' even though he's slow. u sure it cant just be the high temp making him act like that? like, what if i just give him a double dose of tylenol to knock the fever down and see if he clears up in an hour?",
